  "source_pdf": "downloads/wukong-visits-the-dentist-v1.pdf",
  "source_sha256": "6ec74cccfad7e0f5805de3b0a5b6b584644f0426a8c843d183250b004d0ed449",
  "pixel_width": 1224,
  "pages": [
    {
      "image": "page-01.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "08865fd0e1d76c56ab616afadbc5bf5b55aea61cb8beb852f4522ec36f2f0c0c",
      "text": "Wukong Visits\nthe Dentist",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-02.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "8986f3ba14d35ae890eed143abc67e63ff29361f78f4610d685d6f2c47d3af1d",
      "text": "Today Wukong\nvisits the dentist.\nSandy comes too.\n2",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-03.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "91741214d58a0a7bd124fcc18f507edbac84c696f11cefb6722e82bfcf279554",
      "text": "Pigsy is in the waiting room.\n“Hi, Wukong!”\nWukong sees a big chair.\n“Wow!”\n3",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-04.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "e3da2f1dfe7334e0f6a29cd5f8c60a2d1c0193fba862fb862e03884c49ef6cfc",
      "text": "Bzzz, bzzz!\n“Is that a big bee?”\nWukong holds Sandy’s hand.\n4",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-05.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "a97e260232d61588404d6645478b4f58b1601063c568a279e8e498413a4cc4b8",
      "text": "The dentist smiles.\nLittle bears are on her shirt.\n“Hello, Wukong!\nLet’s look first.”\n5",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-06.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "d4572ccf1ff27716487107977c92634a0cca7079ca6491540db38fc1866422bc",
      "text": "She shows a little mirror.\n“This helps me look\nat your teeth.”\n6",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-07.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "e8552157c449bf170b91ccc5fa513734ace0c42a2fe25ff6f3004c73b24b74c9",
      "text": "“If you want to stop,\nraise your hand.\nThen I will stop.”\nWukong nods.\n7",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-08.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "8d75085c27217692769ee8f929d6a8c4e7cda845d757ae8dc33b2d76af820633",
      "text": "Wukong climbs into the chair.\n“Ready?” asks the dentist.\nUp, up, up it goes!\n“Like a little cloud!”\n8",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-09.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "7b0a549bc3d01ab7c03ce1cb1c73a1e5aedc040391e0442dbe0796c7fce2c6cf",
      "text": "“Open wide,” says the dentist.\n“Ahhh!”\nShe looks at each tooth.\n9",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-10.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "37d81030a2a0cd866aa9c9bd29da272ba2a38bbffc7373d0e7bda311b4b0f618",
      "text": "Bzzz!\nWukong feels scared.\nHe raises his hand.\n10",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-11.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "0c4e2eaf649bf0f139de248de9a6ffac97a46fabd232d31885a08fbe5e52334d",
      "text": "The dentist stops.\n“Okay. We can stop.”\nSandy holds his hand.\n11",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-12.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "3dee37e7321757079a49674fa1089a9a6f015d8ecc9374428fd3e5bb8fdbc446",
      "text": "Wukong asks,\n“What makes the bzzz?”\n“My little brush,” she says.\n“It tickles.”\n12",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-13.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "2c4bff5a400357acb2b32f859bcc784ebe7f89b0b2e2af08e843482717f25762",
      "text": "“Now I am ready,”\nsays Wukong.\nHe opens wide again.\n13",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-14.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "3c95076f646d40640791c8c2fef00a6775ba2068dd9fa322bb6f4254e679104a",
      "text": "Bzzz, bzzz.\nTickle, tickle!\n“All done!” says the dentist.\n14",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-15.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "d8f9fc85d3ad6791ddd3e55975ee4695a4f0f2467781ee58a2183461b84ed22b",
      "text": "Wukong smiles in the mirror.\n“I told you what I needed!”\nAs he leaves, the dentist\ngives him a little toothbrush.\n15",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-16.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "9eb456e5733b9da9522cdd8251afb38e0da909ebff00cbd51623cab7cb65ac58",
      "text": "At home, Pigsy’s toys line up.\n“Open wide!” says Wukong.\n“If you want to stop,\nraise your paw!”\n16",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-17.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "d22637ab6fc3dba430ef0766620f48df979b60ce1dd6eb422e5d1b92cb88016b",
      "text": "Wukong & Friends\nThank you for reading!\nWe hope you and your little reader\nenjoyed this little adventure.\nMore free stories\nphg1024.github.io/wukong-and-friends\nRead, download and print - always free.\nRead more free stories\nIf you enjoyed our stories, you are welcome\nto help the next one grow. Support is optional.\nBuy Me a Coffee\nGitHub Sponsors\nCreated by Peihong Guo\nStories and illustrations made with AI assistance and human editing.\n© 2026 Peihong Guo\nCC BY-NC-ND 4.0 · Attribution · NonCommercial · NoDerivatives\ncreativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-nd/4.0/",
